Document the first positive shippable lever on the 0.08 wall: exploration diversity. Random reaches
3/11 first-win vs structured 1/11 (the depth_first_ride over-commits to one branch, missing easy
structure-missed wins r11l/sp80). The hybrid (structured-first + random-on-stall) gets 3/11 while
keeping lp85's efficient win -> dominates both pure baselines on averaged score. General + shippable
(wire random-restart into the submitted explorer behind a flag). 8-game hard tail = frontier research.

